{"id":"666664","name":"烤羊腿","author":"美拉拉的美食日记","authorId":"11567944","desc":"","cover":"images/666664/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲜羊腿","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半个"},{"name":"苹果","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲜羊腿一个改好花刀备用。","img":"images/666664/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱和苹果切碎备用。","img":"images/666664/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入蚝油、生抽、辣椒粉，少许白糖拌匀。","img":"images/666664/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入羊腿腌制四小时左右。","img":"images/666664/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"摆入锡纸中盖好。","img":"images/666664/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"送入烤箱上下火180度烤约五十分钟。","img":"images/666664/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"打开锡纸盖，倒掉汤汁再180度烤十分钟左右。","img":"images/666664/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"汤汁收干后就可食用。","img":"images/666664/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}